The following modifications were made for this distribution:

  - the package was renamed from "@linxin666/dsh-client-ui-git-graph"
    to "dsh-git-graph-sidebar";
  - the workspace access gate was widened from an exact match against a
    registered workspace path to "the path resolves inside a registered
    workspace", so nested repositories can be addressed (this keeps the
    pre-existing guard that rejects every path outside the workspace);
  - a "/git/repos" HTTP route with multi-repository discovery
    (src/host/repos.ts region in lib/index.js) was added;
  - a better-sidebar tab ("src/client/graph/SidebarTab.js", spliced into
    lib/client.js, and likewise copied verbatim into the npm tarball) was
    added: repository tree, SVG lane canvas, zoom and a pinned commit card;
  - locale keys prefixed "sidebar." were added to both dictionaries.

